    "tablehtml": "<h1><u>Corrigenda</u></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">WHO Classification of Tumours, 5th edition:<br />Urinary and Male Genital Tumours</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Most recent corrigenda update to this volume online: <span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">21 Nov 2022</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h1>Summary of corrections:</h1>\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: black;\">Collecting duct carcinoma (p. 60)</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">The text has been clarified as shown.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 487.1pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"1\" width=\"649\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Original text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Corrected text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Histopathology</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">&hellip;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><em>Immunohistochemistry</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">The diagnosis of CDC requires careful exclusion of urothelial carcinoma and metastasis, particularly when limited tissue is available. CDCs are typically positive for high-molecular-weight cytokeratins (34&beta;E12), <span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">CK19, CK7,</span> and PAX8 &hellip;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Histopathology</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">&hellip;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><em>Immunohistochemistry</em></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">The diagnosis of CDC requires careful exclusion of urothelial carcinoma and metastasis, particularly when limited tissue is available. CDCs are typically positive for high-molecular-weight cytokeratins (34&beta;E12), <span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">low-molecular-weight cytokeratins (e.g. CK19, CK7),</span> and PAX8 &hellip;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Updated online: Yes, in most recent corrigenda update<br />Updated in print: Yes (in 2nd print run), November 2022</span></p>\r\n<h2>Fumarate hydratase&ndash;deficient renal cell carcinoma (p. 78)</h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">The legend of Fig. 2.52C (Fig. #20531 online) has been corrected as shown.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 487.1pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"1\" width=\"649\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Original text</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Corrected text</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Fig. 2.52C (Fig. #20531 online)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">The cells show at least focal eosinophilic macronucleoli, often with <span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">perinuclear</span> haloes.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Fig. 2.52C (Fig. #20531 online)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">The cells show at least focal eosinophilic macronucleoli, often with <span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">perinucleolar</span> haloes.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Updated online: Yes, in most recent corrigenda update<br />Updated in print: Yes (in 2nd print run), November 2022</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: black;\">Clear cell adenocarcinoma of the urinary tract (p. 188)</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">The term &ldquo;clear cell adenocarcinoma&rdquo; has been removed from the list of related terminology because it is the name of the entity.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 487.1pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"1\" width=\"649\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Original text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Corrected text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Related terminology</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -8.55pt; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.55pt;\"><em>Acceptable:</em> M&uuml;llerian-type tumour, clear cell type<span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">; clear cell adenocarcinoma</span>.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Related terminology</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.05pt; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 13.05pt;\"><em>Acceptable:</em> M&uuml;llerian-type tumour, clear cell type.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Updated online: Yes, in most recent corrigenda update<br />Updated in print: Yes (in 2nd print run), November 2022</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: black;\">Endometrioid carcinoma of the urinary tract (p.&nbsp; 191)</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">The text has been corrected as shown.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 487.1pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"1\" width=\"649\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Original text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Corrected text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Staging</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-indent: 8.55pt; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">The eighth-edition TNM staging system of the American Joint Committee on Cancer (AJCC) has been created for bladder urothelial carcinoma and is also used for other epithelial tumours of the bladder&nbsp;&hellip;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Staging</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-indent: 13.05pt; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">The eighth-edition TNM staging system of the American Joint Committee on Cancer (AJCC)&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">/ Union for International Cancer Control (UICC)</span> has been created for bladder urothelial carcinoma and is also used for other epithelial tumours of the bladder&nbsp;&hellip;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Updated online: Yes, in most recent corrigenda update<br />Updated in print: Yes (in 2nd print run), November 2022</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: black;\">Extramammary Paget disease (p. 381)</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">The text has been corrected as shown.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 487.1pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"1\" width=\"649\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Original text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Corrected text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Related terminology</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -8.55pt; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 8.55pt;\"><em>Acceptable:</em> Paget<span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">&rsquo;s</span> disease<span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">; extramammary Paget disease; extramammary Paget&rsquo;s disease</span>.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Related terminology</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: -13.05pt; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 13.05pt;\"><em>Acceptable:</em> Paget disease.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Updated online: Yes, in most recent corrigenda update<br />Updated in print: Yes (in 2nd print run), November 2022</span></p>\r\n<h2><span style=\"color: black;\">Mixed epithelial and stromal tumour of the seminal vesicle (p. 241)</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"page-break-after: avoid;\">An erroneous reference citation has been removed as shown.</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"width: 487.1pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"1\" width=\"649\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Original text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; background: #DEEAF6; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black;\">Corrected text</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Clinical features</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">Patients often present with obstructive lower urinary tract symptoms, haematospermia, fever, or abdominal pain <span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">(284)</span>. &hellip;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Clinical features</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\">Patients often present with obstructive lower urinary tract symptoms, haematospermia, fever, or abdominal pain. &hellip;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Epidemiology</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">Twelve</span> cases of MESTs of the seminal vesicle have been reported with sufficient histopathological description (<span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">284,​</span>7,​971,​1397,​1639,​1810,​2054,​2075,​2205,​2636,​2994,​3158). &hellip;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 243.55pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"325\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><strong>Epidemiology</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; page-break-after: avoid;\"><span style=\"color: #c00000; background: #D9D9D9;\">About a dozen</span> cases of MESTs of the seminal vesicle have been reported with sufficient histopathological description (7,​971,​1397,​1639,​1810,​2054,​2075,​2205,​2636,​2994,​3158). &hellip;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 487.1pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; padding: 7.1pt 5.4pt 7.1pt 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"649\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">References cited above:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">7.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Abe H, Nishimura T, Miura T, et al. Cystosarcoma phyllodes of the seminal vesicle. Int J Urol. 2002 Oct;9(10):599&ndash;601. PMID: {12445241}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: #c00000;\">284.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; color: #c00000;\"> Barrett J, Birrer MJ, Kato GJ, et al. Activation domains of L-Myc and c-Myc determine their transforming potencies in rat embryo cells. Mol Cell Biol. 1992 Jul;12(7):3130&ndash;7. PMID: {1620120}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">971.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Fain JS, Cosnow I, King BF, et al. Cystosarcoma phyllodes of the seminal vesicle. Cancer. 1993 Mar 15;71(6):2055&ndash;61. PMID: {8382998}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">1397.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Hoshi A, Nakamura E, Higashi S, et al. Epithelial stromal tumor of the seminal vesicle. Int J Urol. 2006 May;13(5):640&ndash;2. PMID: {16771745 }</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">1639.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Khan MS, Zaheer LU, Ahmed K, et al. Low-grade phyllodes tumor of the seminal vesicle treated with laparoscopic excision. Nat Clin Pract Urol. 2007 Jul;4(7):395&ndash;400. PMID: {17615551}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">1810.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Laurila P, Leivo I, M&auml;kisalo H, et al. M&uuml;llerian adenosarcomalike tumor of the seminal vesicle. A case report with immunohistochemical and ultrastructural observations. Arch Pathol Lab Med. 1992 Oct;116(10):1072&ndash;6. PMID:&nbsp;{1329693}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">2054.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Masuo Y, Taniguchi H, Matsuzaki T, et al. Robot-assisted laparoscopic vesicule prostatectomy for mixed epithelial-stromal tumor of seminal vesicle. IJU Case Rep. 2020 Apr 19;3(3):103&ndash;7. PMID: {32743484}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">2075.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Mazur MT, Myers JL, Maddox WA. Cystic epithelial-stromal tumor of the seminal vesicle. Am J Surg Pathol. 1987 Mar;11(3):210&ndash;7. PMID: {3030148}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">2205.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Monica B, Larosa M, Facchini F, et al. Low grade epithelial stromal tumour of the seminal vesicle. World J Surg Oncol. 2008 Sep 23;6:101. PMID: {18811925}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">2636.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Reikie BA, Yilmaz A, Medlicott S, et al. Mixed epithelial-stromal tumor (MEST) of seminal vesicle: a proposal for unified nomenclature. Adv Anat Pathol. 2015 Mar;22(2):113&ndash;20. PMID: {25664946}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">2994.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Son HJ, Jeong YJ, Kim JH, et al. Phyllodes tumor of the seminal vesicle: case report and literature review. Pathol Int. 2004 Dec;54(12):924&ndash;9. PMID: {15598315}</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\">3158.</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt;\"> Thway K, Freeman A, Woodhouse CR, et al. Epithelial-stromal tumor of seminal vesicle in a patient with chromophobe renal cell carcinoma and small lymphocytic lymphoma. Ann Diagn Pathol. 2008 Dec;12(6):433&ndash;9. PMID: {18995209}</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%;\">Updated online: Yes, in most recent corrigenda update<br />Updated in print: Yes (in 3rd print run), November 2022</span></p>",
